What will be the output of the following code snippet?
int calc(int x)
{
    if (x >= 50) x = 50;
    else if (x <= 20) x = 20;
    else x = 35;
    return 2*x;
}
int main()
{
    int y = 25, z = 35;

    z = calc(y);
    printf("y = %d, z = %d\n", y, z);
    return 0;
}
(a) y = 35, z = 35
(b) y = 25, z = 35
(c) y = 25, z = 70
(d) y = 35, z = 70

